-Generates deterministic colors for arbitrary unseen IDs using hash functions, whereas Semantic TF Design uses PCA to interpolate between expert-designed TFs [G]. Choose when you need consistent coloring for categorical labels rather than adjustable visual properties [4667-semantic-label-colormap-generation.md].
